= Reproducibility

All data used during this thesis is openly available on the websites where they are distributed (#link("https://www.data.gouv.fr/")[data.gouv.fr]):
- The @bdtopo dataset is available at #link("https://www.data.gouv.fr/datasets/bd-topo-r")[data.gouv.fr/datasets/bd-topo-r]
- The @lidarhd dataset is available at #link("https://www.data.gouv.fr/datasets/nuages-de-points-lidar-hd")[data.gouv.fr/datasets/nuages-de-points-lidar-hd]

An implementation of the method proposed in this thesis is available at #link("https://github.com/alexandre-bry/MSc_Thesis-Code")[github.com/alexandre-bry/MSc_Thesis-Code].
All instructions to run the code and reproduce the results are available there, including the versions of the dependencies, and commands to download the data from the official sources.
The validation dataset will also be published, and the link will be displayed in the same repository.

There is also another repository containing the notes, weekly reports and other materials produced during the thesis at #link("https://github.com/alexandre-bry/MSc_Thesis-Report")[github.com/alexandre-bry/MSc_Thesis-Report].
The content of this repository is also available in the form of a website, which link can be found in the GitHub repository.
